[0.982678, "o", "                  \r\n                                                              \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n↑↓ move · Tab pane · C-b Tab Target · ↵ open · n new · / filte\u001b[39m\u001b[40;62H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m\r?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Help\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Quit\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1mC-b d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Detach\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m+\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m More\u001b[49m\u001b[1;64H ▐▛███▜▌   Claude Code v2.1.220\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;64H▝▜█████▛▘  Opus 5 (1M context) · API Usage Billing\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;64H  ▘▘ ▝▝    /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[4;64H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;147m\n❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252mExplain why a 76x30 Railmux terminal uses the compact single-page projection while a 160x38 terminal remains in the ordinary wide sidebar-\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;64H  plus-agent layout. Cite the exact responsive-layout symbols and one existing focused test. Suggest one website-recorder assertion that\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[7;64H  prevents a desktop demo from accidentally using compact mode.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[8;64H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mVerify responsive layout gates\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[10;64H  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252mpresentation_for_geometry() selects the projection from geometry with hysteresis.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[11;64H  From WorkspacePresentation.WIDE it enters COMPACT when either dimension is cramped: width < COMPACT_ENTER_WIDTH (80) or height <\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[12;64H  COMPACT_ENTER_HEIGHT (24).\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[13;64H  76x30: width 76 < 80, so it returns COMPACT even though 30 rows clear the height gate.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[14;64H  160x38: 160 ≥ 80 and 38 ≥ 24, so it stays WIDE with sidebar plus agent. COMPACT_EXIT_WIDTH/HEIGHT (84/26) only applies once already compact.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[15;64H  Existing focused test: tests/test_agent_workspace.py::test_compact_presentation_uses_two_dimensional_hysteresis pins both width and height\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[16;64H  behavior.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[17;64H  Recorder guard: pass each non-mobile profile through presentation_for_geometry and assert WorkspacePresentation.WIDE.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[18;64H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[39;64H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[40;64H─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
