[9.948832, "o", "────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;244m\r\nt term · F8 layout · F9 fullscreen\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[40;42H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m\r\n?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Help\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Quit\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1mC-b d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Detach\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;244m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m+\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m More\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;44H ▐▛███▜▌   Claude Code v2.1.220\u001b[39m\u001b[52X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;44H▝▜█████▛▘  Opus 5 (1M context) · API Usage Billing\u001b[39m\u001b[33X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;44H  ▘▘ ▝▝    /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[25X\u001b[4;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252mExplain why a 76x30 Railmux terminal uses the compact single-page projection\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;44H  while a 160x38 terminal remains in the ordinary wide sidebar-plus-agent\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[7;44H  layout. Cite the exact responsive-layout symbols and one existing focused\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[8;44H  test. Suggest one website-recorder assertion that prevents a desktop demo from\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[9;44H  accidentally using compact mode.\u001b[39m\u001b[49X\u001b[10;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mVerify responsive layout gates\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[51X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[12;44H  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252mpresentation_for_geometry() selects the projection from geometry with\u001b[39m\u001b[12X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[13;44H  hysteresis.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[14;44H  From WorkspacePresentation.WIDE it enters COMPACT when either dimension is\u001b[39m\u001b[7X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[15;44H  cramped: width < COMPACT_ENTER_WIDTH (80) or height < COMPACT_ENTER_HEIGHT (24).\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[16;44H  76x30: width 76 < 80, so it returns COMPACT even though 30 rows clear the height\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[17;44H  gate.\u001b[39m\u001b[76X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[18;44H  160x38: 160 ≥ 80 and 38 ≥ 24, so it stays WIDE with sidebar plus agent.\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[19;44H  COMPACT_EXIT_WIDTH/HEIGHT (84/26) only applies once already compact.\u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[20;44H  Existing focused test: tests/test_agent_workspace.py::test_compact_presentation_\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[21;44H  uses_two_dimensional_hysteresis pins both width and height behavior.\u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[22;44H  Recorder guard: pass each non-mobile profile through presentation_for_geometry\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[23;44H  and assert WorkspacePresentation.WIDE.\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\u001b[24;44H\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;239m\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[39;44H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[81X\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[40;44H──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[41;44H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[31X\u001b[1;128H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n                                \u001b[38;5;70m\u001b[1mRAILMUX  ·  PANE 2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[20;128H                              \u001b[37m\u001b